window.products.push({"id":189037,"name":"What Doesn't Kill You Makes You Stronger. Funny Coffee & Tea Mug For Mom, Mama, Dad, Pop, Employee, Coworker, Boss, Friend, Bestfriend, Friends, Moms,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dw5Ycc08L._AC_.jpg","description":"GIVE THE BEST EVERY TIME! The best gifts are both personal and functional, and that’s why this awesome, original mug is a fantastic choice for nearly any occasion. Your best friend knows how you crack a joke. But your coworker doesn’t. Your joke may be hazardous but they’re not deadly. It would actually make them smarter. This mug will definitely send that message if you display it. Time to get your sarcastic friend a good item. With this mug, her sarcasm is now complete – strong black coffee and lines of dark jokes for a murderous laugh. How creative are you? With your dark sense of humor and your dark coffee you can definitely create an outstanding report. This 15 ounce, white ceramic coffee mug has a large, easy-to-grip C-handle and is both microwave and dishwasher safe. The premium full color sublimation imprint appears on both sides of this 15 ounce, white ceramic mug. Each mug is crafted from the highest grade ceramic, and our designs are printed and sublimated in the United States. GET YOUR MUG TODAY!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dw5Ycc08L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Make Your Mark Design","source_asin":"B07V5BJQPS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V5BJQPS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V5BJQPS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
