window.products.push({"id":189136,"name":"Large Tree Wall Art Hand-Painted Landscape Forest Oil Painting Gallery Wrapped Framed Canvas Bird Birch Artwork 'White Birch at Night' for Living Room","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RGhoIx41L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"This piece brings nature home in style. The artist paint a tranquil birch tree forest picture -white birch are set against in the clear moonlight night sky, bird inhabit branch. The blurred background of sky give it a sense of depth of field and really makes the birch tree pop and gives it a very realistic feel. Gold foil embellishment of bird adds a shiny touch to this landscape art. The ''white birch at night'' canvas is hand-painted oil painting with thick paint embellishments as well as gold foil accents. SPECIFICATION: Subject: Landscape & nature wall art Size: 48*24\" (Custom order acceptable) Material: Professional acrylic/oil paints, canvas, hand-painted. Packing: This large wall art are wrapped on frames, bracket mounted, protected by plastic bags and carton box. Features Beautifully birch painting on canvas stretched over wood stretcher bars Gold foil and thick paint embellishment produces rich texture Ready to hang with gallery wrapped edges Hang securely with two D-ring hangers or lean it against the wall to display on a mantel Due to hand-painting, no two will be exactly the same","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RGhoIx41L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"amatop","source_asin":"B08H8LCNTD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H8LCNTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H8LCNTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
