window.products.push({"id":189182,"name":"Burfocus Silicone Faucet Mat , Sink Splash Guard, Silicone Faucet Handle Drip Catcher Tray, Sponge Holder Sink Protector for Kitchen Bathroom Farmhous","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510cpgtqw6L._AC_.jpg","description":"【MULTIFUNCTION & UPGRADED DESIGN】Kitchen Sink Splash Guard is not only a faucet drying pad, can also be a sponge holder in kitchen for sponge, soap, cups, hand sanitizer, dish soap. Silicone Faucet Mat is designed with draining, it gathers water and drips it to the sink.15.4 x 5.9 inches, fits the faucet tube within 3.2 inch. 【Tips: Please confirm the size before purchase】 【LONGER AND ADJUSTABLE】Silicone faucet mat is made of food grade silicone, Soft and reliable. Newly designed Kitchen Sink Splash Guard is size more longer, We have increased the size and thickness of our products. For a wider kitchen sink design, many kitchen gadgets can be stored. Perfect kitchen sink accessories. 【REUSABLE & EASY TO CLEAN】Sink Splash Guard is not easy to break or fade and can be reused for a long time. Foldable is also convenient for storage! silicone faucet drip catcher mat can be washed directly in the dishwasher. No need to clean or replace frequently. No need to wipe the sink counter top after each use of the sink splash guard. 【WIDE APPLICATION】The silicone faucet drip catcher mat easily fit around the base of your kitchen sink, bathroom, farmhouse,RV or restroom to keep clean and dry. Upgrade the size of the increase, you can put more kitchen small things. Used as an mat, drain pad. It is a super practical kitchen & bathroom gadgets. 【PERFECT KITCHEN GIFT FOR YOU】If you are looking for Silicone Faucet Drip Catcher Tray covers that will integrate with your kitchen or bathroom to create the perfect sink accessories, then this is the set for you. The Silicone Faucet Handle Drip Catcher Tray is widely used in kitchen, bathroom, rv, campers, can be a great gift idea for family and friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510cpgtqw6L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"burfocus","source_asin":"B0C1NG6HT5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1NG6HT5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1NG6HT5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":189183,"name":"Treehouse Designs popKern Microwave Silicone Popcorn Popper - PVC & BPA Free - Free Gift Silicone Pot Holders (Neon Blueberry)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qJo5rG2TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PREMIUM GRADE SILICONE - The popKern is manufactured using premium grade, heat resistant silicone (LFGB) that exceeds FDA standards and is PVC and BPA free. Making and popcorn and watching your favorite movies, shows or sports has never been easier, safer and healthier than with the popKern from TreeHouse Designs. Go ahead take the pinch test, the popKern color does NOT change. CONVENIENT TO STORE, USE AND CLEAN - The popKern conveniently collapses into a small footprint (2.5\" tall) to save space in your kitchen. When opened fully (5.5\" tall), the popKern turns into a large bowl can make almost 15 cups of popcorn without any additives or oils with fewer unpopped kernels. When you've enjoyed the popcorn and movie just place it on the top rack of your dishwasher. FREE GIFT SILICONE POT HOLDERS - The popKern has two convenient heat resistant handles to easily and safely remove the popKern from the microwave and there are two separate pot holders to use in case your microwave was on \"ludicrous.\" The pot holders have a high heat resistance and can safely be used on other pots, pans and cooking utensils. FAST POPPING, MORE FLAVORS - The popKern's design maximizes the heat distribution to ensure that you enjoy every kernel in 4 minutes or less. Add your favorite flavors to the kernels and have your movie or sports experience in the convenience of your home. HEALTHY GIFT IDEA - The popKern's a great gift idea for the movie-buff, sports-nut or gamer, they can make the popcorn flavor of your choice with healthy (or sinful) options. The popKern is the easiest way to enjoy crisp, warm homemade popcorn without the hassle of a stovetop maker, the noise of an electric popper and the preservatives of the popcorn bag.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qJo5rG2TL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TreeHouse Designs","source_asin":"B01N4RGXIH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N4RGXIH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N4RGXIH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
