window.products.push({"id":189264,"name":"YARENH Cleaver Knife Set with Magnetic Block, 5 Piece Professional Sharp Chef Knives for Kitchen, Damascus Stainless Steel, 73 Layers, Full Tang, Sand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":300.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mg+BvCxnL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"[Premium Quality] Our knife is made up of 73 layers of Damascus steel(10Cr15CoMoV steel core),which is a Chinese stainless steel.and the forging process of the knife provides our customers with the high quality sharp Damascus steel kitchen knife for the ultimate sophisticated cutting experience. [Damascus Steel Blade] Our blade is made up of 73 layers of Damascus steel. The 10Cr15CoMoV high carbon steel is selected for the steel core, whose hardness is stable at 60 ± 2HRC, for that ultra-sharpness and durability of the blade.The Damascus steel blade contains Cr, Mo, Co ingredient, making it more rust-resistant, more wear-resistant, better sharpness. [Sandalwood Wood Handle] The handle of the blade is made from sandalwood, which will not shrink, fade or deform. The handle size, length and shape are ergonomically designed to provide better grip, comfort, agility and reduce fatigue that is caused even after prolonged use. Please note that there may be differences in the color and he texture of the handle because of the different growth location and seasons. [Magnetic Knife Block] The premium magnetic stand has durable neodymium magnets hidden inside and because of these in-built magnets, the knives will stick to the surface of the block, because of this the knives are completely visible, so that you will never grab the wrong knife. [Package Contents & Easy-Maintenance] 8 inch chef knife×1, 7.5 inch cleaver knife×1,7 inch santoku knife×1, 5 inch kitchen utility knife×1, magnetic block×1 and please make sure to rinse and wipe your blade after every usage, so that the acidic contents are removed and your blade stays new for a longer period of time. Also, if you are not satisfied with the product, within one month of the purchase, feel free to raise a refund request, so that we will process with the unconditional refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mg+BvCxnL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YARENH","source_asin":"B07N496176","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189264","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N496176","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N496176","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
