window.products.push({"id":189425,"name":"Rosanna Red Velvet 11-Inch Sweets Tray, Gift-boxed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813oXNkivES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description The elaborate scrollwork and leaf pattern of a Parisian iron gate is captured in a seductive shade of scarlet, lending richness to your table for the holidays and beyond. The four distinctive designs are especially enchanting when layered with white dinner plates. This collection is made of refined porcelain, it is microwave and dishwasher safe. Amazon.com Red Velvet porcelain from Rosanna evokes the luxurious velvet damask and flocked wallpaper made fashionable in 18th-century France. Absolutely stunning, this square sweets tray shows off crimson scrolls, flourishes, leaves, and blossoms that are so intense they seem to leap off the white background. With its white ceramic loop handle for carrying, the 11-inch scalloped tray is perfect for serving guests cookies, brownies, or candies. Especially appropriate during the holidays, Red Velvet sets a dramatic buffet table for coffee and dessert, and vividly accents solid white dinnerware. Geared toward the sweeter indulgences in life, the Red Velvet collection consists simply of an oval platter, small appetizer plates, and coffee mugs, in addition to the sweets tray. Because the edges of the refined porcelain are trimmed with red instead of gold, the pieces are conveniently safe for use in the microwave and dishwasher, freeing up valuable time for more important things. Rosanna's gift boxes are just as collectible as their contents, as this square box adorned with the Red Velvet patterning attests. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813oXNkivES._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosanna","source_asin":"B000TK655A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189425","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000TK655A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000TK655A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
