window.products.push({"id":189444,"name":"ALAYRAC Bath Mat for Bathroom Thick Non-Slip Bath Rags Strong Absorbent Shaggy Shower Rug Carpet ( Ivory White, 20x32, Machine Washable)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Izbt1blgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ Absorbent & Quick Dry: The thick shaggy bath mat, which is 7 times absorbent than cotton, can soak up more water like a super sponge; Meanwhile, compared to chenille mats, these upgraded luxurious shag rugs can keep your floor dry faster, keeping away from any mildew or moldy, and are friendly to children and pets; Without any worry about spilling the water everywhere while you're stepping out of the Shower, Jacuzzi or Bathtub. ❤ No-Slip & Safety Use: The backing is made from top non-slip TPR rubber with non-slip bulge pattern, which create maximal friction between the mat itself and smooth floor, avoid any slip risk. Besides the strong rubber particles is much more durable for long time safe use than other normal ones. Use Tip: we suggest you place mat on CLEAN DRY SMOOTH FLOOR only. Water under rug can cause it to potential slip. Always keep the bottom of the rug dry. ❤ Soft & Warm: the 20x32 cushioned bath mat for bathroom is made of super soft and fluffy polyester microfiber shags; hugs your toes with the cozy contentment of a bathroom floor mat from threshold. The higher and softer piles than most other ones, offers you additional comforts and shields your toes from the icy floor in cold winter. ❤ Easy Care & Machine Washable: Wash it separately in cold water using mild detergent. Tumble dry on low setting and shake to restore fluff. After 8 times machine wash test, the ALAYRAC bath mat still looks as good as the new one. No worry about it getting the fibers off, it's really easy to handle and care. Your bath mat neither sheds, nor comes entangled with any hair from human or pets; makes someone you care about get rid of the irritability caused by hair. ❤ 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Color may slightly vary due to photographic lighting sources or your monitor settings. At ALAYRAC, our products have 23 years of offline sales experience, and customer satisfaction is our #1 priority - 24/7 Customer Service Stands By. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Izbt1blgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"A ALAYRAC","source_asin":"B093C3L4DV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189444","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093C3L4DV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093C3L4DV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
