window.products.push({"id":189446,"name":"Samovar Free Energy Water Heater 4l /150 Oz Semaver Samavar Boat Camping Hiking Hunting Yachting Tea Kettle Urn Tea-urn BBQ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wBWA4rL5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"DESCRIPTION: - Traditional Turkish Samovar - Usable with wood/kindling or coal - Has metal handles - Has a hot water tap - Samovar is used to boil water and brew tea using the teapot on top - The top compartment can be removed so that the bottom part can be used as a BBQ - Keep heat for a long time - It is very useful in tents, campers, boats etc. - The combustion controlled through the cover. Close the cover when you want to continue burning. Because samovar goes to sleep - Use this for heating and hot water supply for washing up even shower! - Offers you a unforgettably tasty tea and hot drinks. Essential piece of camping kit if you like a hot cuppa, soup , coffee etc. - can easily ignite and use in balconies, verandas or gardens. - Fissionable, easily portable! This samovar is It is Composed of 6 pieces. - 7 liters capacity options - Two tap samovar: built a teapot and second tap in water reservoir for tea, it's used for making tea with loose INSTRUCTIONS TO USE: - fill the bottom compartment with firewood and set alight - fill the top with water - smoke comes out the middle through a stainless steel chimney , - the chimney runs through the water tank(obviously the chimney is sealed), - the fire can also be fed through the chimney, -no charcoal is needed , dry bits of firewood/grass do fine. very economical = FREE ENERGYl! -water boils in the top compartment -there is a place on the top where you can sit a small teapot (not included) to keep it warm in the steam.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wBWA4rL5L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"istanbulsamovar","source_asin":"B01F0IE0Y8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189446","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01F0IE0Y8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01F0IE0Y8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
