window.products.push({"id":189581,"name":"HOMI CHEF Mirror Polished NICKEL FREE Stainless Steel 6 QT(Quart) Stock Pot/Soup Pot with Glass Lid (No Toxic Non Stick Coating, Whole-Clad 3-Ply) - C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PZq-7tWTL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"ENJOY THE FINE ART OF EVERYDAY FAMILY COOKING 1. With shiny MIRROR-POLISHED pan body, you will cut a fine figure both in the kitchen and at the dining table.2. Top quality build: 2.3MM in base and walls thickness; 5.4 lbs in weight; THICK & HEAVY.3. Designed to cook large batches of soup, stew, fricassees, pasta for the whole family.4. Compatible with gas, induction, ceramic and halogen cook tops; oven & dishwasher safe. HEALTHIER COOKWARE HEALTHIER LIFE 1. Unlike most nickel-bearing 18/8 (Cr: Ni) and 18/10 stainless steel cookware products on the market, ours are healthier because they contain NO nickel, which harms health.2. Whole-clad 3-ply construction and heat surround features achieve the natural stick resistance, without toxic non-stick coating. MORE VALUES 1. Whole-clad 3-ply base and sides allow for fast and even heating.2. Heat surround technology for shorter cooking time, better nutrition, and more energy savings.3. Straight sides (5.5\" high) help retain heat and limit evaporation.4. Stay-cool handles ensure safe, comfortable grip and easy lifting. FAQs 1. Nickel helps become more corrosion-resistant, so nickel-bearing stainless steel is commonly used for industrial purposes, BUT nickel is high up on the ATSDR list of priority toxins. Our stock pot is made of food grade NICKEL FREE stainless steel (18/0), which is NON-TOXIC, NON-ALLERGIC, thus more suitable for cookware.2. Even heat distribution achieves the natural stick resistance. Our cookware is satisfactorily stick resistant if used and cared properly. ATTENTION 1. Please keep the pot clean and dry after each use; DO NOT store foods seasoned with salt in it.2. Please remove foods from the refrigerator 10-15 minutes before cooking; pre-heat for 1-2 minutes, add oil before adding food; do not turn the food too soon to prevent sticking.3. Heat at medium temperature.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51PZq-7tWTL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMICHEF","source_asin":"B01MYPC3J4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189581","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MYPC3J4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MYPC3J4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
