window.products.push({"id":189641,"name":"URSTOUD 20PCS Artificial Flowers,Fake Greenery Faux Plastic Bushes Fake Shrubs UV Resistant No Fade Faux Plastic Flowers for Wedding Hanging Bouquet I","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fQV-hfA7L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"High Quality Material The product is made of environmentally friendly plastic, poison-less and harmless, favored by customers.It's not easy to fade or fall. All flowers are look beautiful and vivid. Life-like Fake Artificial Flowers Plastic flowers and leaves, fresh color, poison-less and harmless, each flower come as close to real as can be, offer true-to-life petal and foliage textures. Artificial outdoor flowers are great alternative for real flowers and will remain fresh-looking and beautiful year after year! Home Decoration Flowers are such joyful and energetic presence, they are known to make people better and happier and they are sunshine, food and medicine for the soul. Flowers lighten up any setting and bring in a sense of exclusivity to the place. DIY Floral Arrangements with Artificial Flowers Artificial flowers are perfect for wedding, bridle bouquet, party, birthdays, holidays, everyday decoration etc. They also can fit with indoor, outdoor, home, garden, hotel, store, kitchen, office, table, vase, porch, yard etc. Let your courtyard look no longer monotonous and full of life.Don't bother like real flowers at all,don't need pay too much attention to it. Attention 1.Please put the flowers far away from any fire sources such as candles 2.Because of packing,the flowers would be agminated when you get them.At this time,you need to move them with your hand,and adjust each flower as your pleases.You can also adjust the flower stem as you like,cut the extra stem down or bend the stem over 3.Never put the artificial flowers under water for a long time,especially under warm water,which will cause it fade 4.Because of the faux plant is made of plastic,there might be some smell. Please put it in a ventilated place for about 1-2 days.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fQV-hfA7L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"URSTOUD","source_asin":"B091MKWPZL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091MKWPZL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091MKWPZL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
