window.products.push({"id":189716,"name":"Haperlare Tree Branches Kitchen Curtains 36 Inches Farmhouse Tier Window Curtains Teal Floral Twig Design Cafe Curtains on White Linen Textured Small ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KvyhQ+bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heavy Weight Linen Texture Semi-sheer curtains With 190 Gsm (Gram Per Square Meter) Ready Made: Each package includes 2 panel tree branch kitchen tier curtain, measuring W27 x L36 inches each, W54 x L36/set. These tailored tier curtains can be combined with coordinating curtain valance. Quality Material: Our cafe curtains are made of thick and heavy-duty faux linen texture semi-sheer fabric, which feels skin-friendly, sturdy but still touches soft, offers you a comfortable and healthy environment and gives the curtain a nice drop and a luxurious textured Look. Unique Home Decor: The tree branch pattern on white background open weave linen textured inspires a modern aesthetic combining with the bold and dramatic twig design. The classic design makes a graceful and chic appearance to any space. The tree pattern goes well with many decorating styles, modern farmhouse style, classical European style, Mid-century modern style and so on. Serve Well: These tailored bathroom window curtains are classic and presentable, Not only do these curtains provide privacy, they also allow the sun's soft light to gently stream into a room. A perfect enhancement to your your kitchen, bathroom, laundry room, studio or whatever you used them. Easy Install & Care: 2\" rod pocket is easy to hang with a standard or decorative curtain rod. Machine washable in cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry. Cool iron if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KvyhQ+bRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Haperlare","source_asin":"B08HHKDBV2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HHKDBV2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HHKDBV2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":189717,"name":"MZD8391 Dimmable 50 Photo Clips String Lights/Holder with Remote Control, Battery Powered Indoor Fairy String Lights for Hanging Photos Pictures Cards","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RuddMlFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Gifts Choice:Ours is Upgraded Version With 50 LED Clips, brighter than the light with 20 or 30 LED Clips, which can cover more artworks and photos 4 Levels Dimmable & 6 Hours Timer : Press \"Dim-\" Or Press \"Dim+\" On Remote Control To Adjust The Brightness Of The Lights From 100%, 75%, 50%, 25%. Even Got Smart Timer Function To Automatically Have Lights Stay 6h On And 18h Off. Remote Control & 8 Lighting Modes: This Upgraded Version Comes with 8 Lighting Modes to choose from Combination;In wave;Sequential; Slo glo;Chasing/Flash; Slow fade; Twinkle/Flash; Steady On; With a Smart Remote in hand, you can easily turn on/off the lights. All is in your control!. It can be put or hung on walls, windows, doors, floors, ceilings, grasses, Christmas trees etc. No matter indoor or outdoor. Wide Application: They are ideal for hanging photos, holiday cards, children's artwork, or whatever lightweight crafty/decorative items you desire. This makes for a great decoration for any type of situation you have in hand such as a birthday party, wedding Christmas parties or anything you want to make classy. The lights give its touch that makes everything else as the background but in such a good way.Use this LED photo clip string light, it's a romantic way to capture your beautiful memories A Perfect Decoration :Decorative your garden, porch, living room,bedroom, weddings, Valentine's Day, Christmas, home, window, bathroom, festival, Holiday, shows, restaurant, hotel, even the party with the string light to add a beautiful glow to your life. Beyond in house decoration, it can be used in special occasion like Valentine's Day, banquet, propose, wedding displaying your photo, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RuddMlFsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MZD8391","source_asin":"B0BMTBCG6D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMTBCG6D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMTBCG6D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
