window.products.push({"id":189899,"name":"Knee Pillow, Rebound Memory Foam Wedge Contour Leg Pillow for Sleeping - Orthopedic Knee Pillow with Adjustable Strap and Removable Cover for Side Sle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N+DWlWCaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A knee pillow can help you solve a lot of confusion: Restore Proper Sleeping alignment & Reduce Bodily Pain & Stresses  Sleep in a posture that ensures right body alignment such that your joints, hips, knees, lower back are way more relaxed, so you experience no pain upon waking up, and feel more refreshed and rejuvenated after a good night’s sleep.   Slow rebound memory foam and pillow cover,give your skin a comfortable and relaxed enjoyment .The design of the leg pillow is fully ergonomic,no side effects, giving the leg or back reduce pressure,long-term use,can help you build better shapes of legs.  Removable Cover and Adjustable Strap ---The leg pillow uses removable cover and adjustable strap,so it’s simple to use and clean by hand or washing machine.   A Gift Full of Love-- Orthopedic knee pillow is a great gift for your lover,family or friends.Make an investment in their health, I think this is very valuable and meaningful. Relieve body pain: Pregnancy Arthritis  Headaches/Migraines  Before and After Knee Replacement Surgery Hip,knee,leg,joint pain  Injuries  Bursitis  Sciatica  Postural Problems  And so much more…  Stop letting your pain hold you back from living the life you want to live. Warm Tips: * Please place the pillow at a ventilated place for 3 to 5 minutes to dissipate the smell during production and transportation(which is not harmful).  * Treat with care if the product is washed with water(do not tear),pillow core can not be washed. *Avoid direct exposure to sunlight in daily use as the product adopts a temperature-sensing material.  *Product adopts one-shot molding process, so there may be some small holes on the inner core.Which is a normal phenomenon and will not affect normal use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51N+DWlWCaL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"O-NINE","source_asin":"B07VPNZD1L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VPNZD1L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VPNZD1L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
