window.products.push({"id":189958,"name":"Aucma Ice Cream Machines,Portable 1.5 Quart Electric Ice Cream Maker Automatic Frozen Yogurt, Gelato, Sorbet Homemade Dessert For Kids & Adults (24x21","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fdJGWVwUL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"🍨Product information:Voltage(V):220V~240V;Frequency(Hz):50Hz;Capacity(L):1.4L;Power consumption(W):12W;Body Color:White;Housing Material:Plastic. 🍧 IMPORTANT: The ice cream maker does not have freezer function itself. The inner bowl contains refrigerant solution within the double insulated walls,and the frozen refrigerant solution will release the cold during process to freeze ingredients for ice cream. So the inner bowl must be completely frozen before you begin your recipe. Shake the bowl to determine whether it is completely frozen. If you do not hear the liquid within the bowl moving, the refrigerant solution is therefore frozen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61fdJGWVwUL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N-A","source_asin":"B08C2C9ZY7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189958","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C2C9ZY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C2C9ZY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":189959,"name":"TAFTS 22mm 100% Pure Mulberry 6A Silk Pillowcase for Hair & Skin with Envelope Closure, No Zipper, Cooling, Natural, Organic, Double Sided Pillow Case","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X9cFsGO1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️BEAUTY MUST-HAVE: Aside from keeping your hairstyle intact, the smooth silky texture prevents hair breakage caused by friction. What's more—sleeping on a silk pillowcase can help prevent wrinkles and they can actually help make your skin-care products more effective, so bringing them into your bedroom could have a positive impact on your hair and skin, and who doesn't want that? 🙅‍♀️ANTI-AGING & MOISTURIZING - Tafts Silk Pillowcases are made from 100% Pure Mulberry Silk (Grade 6A long fiber), that have natural anti-aging properties that prevent acne and wrinkles by keeping skin moisturized and radiant. Tafts pillowcases are shown to absorb less face cream than cotton pillowcases, so they can help keep your skin moisturized and keep hair natural oils or products where they belong. Plus silk fabrics keep your lashes looking gorgeous overnight. 💁‍♀️ULTRA SLEEK & SMOOTH - Tafts Grade 6A long fiber silk pillowcase features a supertight, 22 momme weave that reduces friction allowing your skin to glide along with the pillow, which can reduce sleep creases on your face. Tafts pillowcase glides freely over your hair, reducing friction and hair thinning from breakages due to dry and knotted hair. 🌡TEMPERATURE REGULATOR + ZIPPERED CLOSURE - Taft's 100% pure mulberry silk is a natural thermal regulator and helps maintain body temperature all night. Ilk is able to capture the air between the silk threads which keeps you cool in the summer and warm in the winter. The concealed zipper closure design keeps the pillowcase seamless and uniform, prevents your pillow from moving around during the night and makes it easy to slip the pillow in and out for frustration-free washing. 🎁PERFECT FOR EVERYONE - WARNING: Tafts Silk Pillowcases are highly addictive. We highly recommend buying a second or third as a backup when washing the other, for travel, or as a gift for someone who enjoys the finer things in life! What's included -1X Tafts Zippered Silk Pillowcase. Please feel free to email us anytime with any questions or concerns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61X9cFsGO1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tafts","source_asin":"B0BN4RLD8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN4RLD8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN4RLD8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
