window.products.push({"id":189964,"name":"Air Fryer Oven OIMIS,32QT X-Large Air Toaster Oven Air Fryer Rotisserie Oven Combo 21 IN 1 1800W Countertop Oven Dual Cook Patented Dual Air Duct Syst","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BbP3EjxCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥩【Air Fryer Oven Combo】OIMIS air fryer oven offers 21 versatile cooking options at the push of a button. This oven can be used as an air fryer, rotisserie, dehydrator, pizza oven, grill, toaster and convection oven, and has a temperature range of 90°F-450°F. The recipes included allow you to explore all these cooking options. 🍗【32QT Large Capacity】OIMIS large air oven with rotisserie,perfect for family or parties of 4-10 people,easily fits 13lbs turkey, a 13-inch pizza (on parchment paper), 6 slices of toast, or an entire cake/pie; the perfect family size to meet your different cooking needs. 🍟【Patented Dual Duct System】The air fryer toaster oven has separate hot and cold ducts. The hot air duct cooks food quickly and evenly, reducing your cooking time by 40%-50%. The cold air duct works to reduce the surface temperature of the oven to keep your kitchen cooler and safer. 🌭【Faster & Healthier】The 1800W high power oven means you can quickly heat the oven to 450°F. The 360° air circulation cooking technology not only bakes food quickly and evenly, but also drains 85% of the fat from your food.Our oven has a extra menus,long press \"MENUS\" about 3-5 seconds will appears four kinds pizza function(F01-F04).Easy operation and health. 🥞【Accessories & Lifetime Service】OIMIS digital air fryer oven come with many components, including common accessories, a cookbook, a user manual,as well as a double-ended screwdriver for easy cleaning of the double tempered glass door. We offer a 12-month warranty and lifetime service guarantee. Please contact us with any issues and we will respond within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BbP3EjxCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OIMIS","source_asin":"B09J1CKYG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-189964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09J1CKYG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09J1CKYG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
